<title>JAPAN: Sakai Iron Works - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Sakai Iron Works - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.53		vs	    8.15</p>
<p> Operating	  146    million    vs	  399    million</p>
<p> Current	    111    million    vs	  276    million</p>
<p> Net		  120    million    vs	  100    million</p>
<p> EPS		    8.90 yen	  vs	    7.36 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     14 million	  vs	  14 million</p>
<p> Interim div		  --	  vs		    --</p>
<p>NOTE - Sakai Iron Works Co Ltd is a medium-scale manufacturer of steel towers for the electric power industry.</p>
